refused: d171_struct_fact_on_a_let.cy:21:17, line 21 column 17
21 |         let $j: index<`text`: $article, `table`: $list> = index[words = Lend $article, lookup = Lend $list];
   |                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 what: `$list` doesn't last as long as `$article`, and `index` says `table` lasts at least as long as `text`
 why:  a struct's `lasts_at_least` fact holds for every type that fills it in (D171)
